ated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n*1 ½ cups [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|all-purpose flour]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] salt\n*¾ cup [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n\n=== Frosting ===\n* ¾ cup granulated sugar\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] bittersweet [[Cookbook:Chocolate|chocolate]], melted\n* ¾ cup milk\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== Cake ===\n#[[Cookbook:Creaming|Cream]] together the butter, sugar, baking powder, salt, and flour\n#Add the milk.\n#Beat the egg and [[Cookbook:Folding|fold]] in. \n#Divide batter between 2 greased and [[Cookbook:Parchment Paper|parchment]]-lined 8-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] (20 cm) round [[Cookbook:Cake Pan|cake pans]]. \n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] about 20–25 minutes at about 350°F (175°C). \n#Cool completely before frosting.\n\n=== Frosting ===\n# Combine all frosting ingredients in a [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]].\n# Heat over medium heat, stirring to dissolve everything.\n# Cook to the [[Cookbook:Cooking Sugar|soft ball stage]].\n# Cool slightly, and spread at once over the cake.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cake]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark chocolate]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Grandmother Grout's Cake","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 tbsp butter","sourceText":"1 tbsp butter","amountText":"1 tbsp butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup granulated sugar","sourceText":"1 cup granulated sugar","amountText":"1 cup granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3",